    "summary": "Photograph of a group Native North Americans, Many Mixtures, Jim Little Leaf and Joe Calf Child, on horse-backs. They are wearing an assortment of feathered head-dresses and costumes; two are carrying rifles and a long lance. A horse and attached transporter is next to the group;  tepees and a man wearing feathered head-dress and wrapped in a blanket are in the background.  \r\nAlbumen print",
